OL,3,ARupert Grint to return to Harry Potter
OL,4,Ain Broadway play
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarry Potter star Rupert Grint is to
OL,7,Freturn to the role of Ron Weasley -
OL,8,Fplaying the character as an adult in
OL,9,Fthe spin-off play in New York.
OL,11,FGrint was first cast to play Ron in the
OL,12,Foriginal films at the age of 11. Now
OL,13,F38, he will join the cast of Harry
OL,14,FPotter and the Cursed Child on Broadway
OL,15,Ffor four months from next February.
OL,17,FThe play catches up with Harry, Ron and
OL,18,FHermione as grown-ups, 19 years after
OL,19,Fthe end of the events in the original
OL,20,Fbooks and films - with Ron and Hermione
OL,21,Fnow married and sending their daughter
OL,22,Fto Hogwarts.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
